{
  "id": "2SA.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Samweli 5",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yeemekhzua abe omuruchi waIsiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana tsimbia tsiosi tsiaIsiraeli tsiamwitsila Daudi eHeberoni, nitsiboola tsiri, Lola, ifwe khuli likumba elala khandi omubili mulala ninawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaalo etsiabira, olwa Saulo yalinii omuruchi weefwe, walinji iwe owasamusinjia Isiraeli nende okhubachelesia; ne OMWAMI yakhusunjila mbu Olaayanga abandu banje Isiraeli, khandi olaba omwimilisi waIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abakofu bosi baIsiraeli nibamutsiila omuruchi eHeberoni; naye omuruchi Daudi yakhola indakano ninabo eHeberoni, imbeli w; nibamutsushiilila Daudi amafura abe omuruchi waIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yali owemiyika amakhumi kataru olwa yachaaka okhuba omuruchi, ne yaruka emiyika amakhumi kane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuHeberoni yaruka Yuda emiyika musaafu nende emiesi chisasaba; khandi muYerusalemu yaruka emiyika amakhumi kataru nachitaru, khuIsiraeli yosi halala nende Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yabukula Sayuni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuruchi nende abandube nibatsia eYerusalemu okhuseera abaYebusi, abali nibamenyanga mushialo eshio; abo nibo abamusunjila Daudi bari Shioleenjila muno tawe; kata ababofu nende abalema balakhwikalila; nibakaala mbu Daudi shianyala okhwinjilamwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Daudi yabukula olukoba lwaSayuni; lienelo nilio litookho liaDaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi yasunga khunyanga eyo, ari Owenya okhuupa abaYebusi, aniinile khumuferechi kwamatsi, akhupe abalema nende ababofu abo abasinya omwoyo kwaDaudi. Niko akachila nibasunga mbu Abalema nende ababofu bareenjila munzu yOMWAMI ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi yamenya mulukoba, nalikulikha mbu litookho liaDaudi. Daudi niyoombakha tsimbeka tsiosi, okhurula eMilo olwo nende mumbeka tsiomukari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi yatsiililila niyeetasa obukhongo; shichila OMWAMI, Nyasaye omwene mahe, yali halala ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hiramu yafuchiilila mbu Daudi niye omuruchi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Hiramu omuruchi waTiro yaruma abarume ewaDaudi, nende emisaala chiemisiita, nende ababaatsi, nende aboombashi bamachina; nibamuumbashila Daudi inzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi yalola shinga OMWAMI olwa yali namureeleho abe omuruchi waIsiraeli, khandi shinga olwa yali nachinguulile oburuchibwe khulwa oluyia lwabandube, Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaana baDaudi abeebulilwa eYerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi yaleera abasuria nende abakhasi bandi abarula mubeYerusalemu, olwa yali narulile eHeberoni; khandi Daudi yameeta okhwibula abaana abasiani nende abakhaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nameera kabeenabo aba yeebulila muYerusalemu ngakano, mbu Shamua, naShobabu, naNatsani, naSulemani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naIbihari, naElishua; naNefegi, naYafia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naElishama, naEliada, naElifeleti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yahula abaFilisui",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa abaFilisiti bahulila shinga olwa bali nibamutsushiiliile Daudi amafura abe omuruchi waIsiraeli, kho abaFilisiti bosi nibatikulukha nibatsia okhukhaaba Daudi; naye Daudi nahulilakhwo, nakholomokha natsia mulukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaFilisiti bali nibeetsile nibasalaanile mwibanda liaRefaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi yareeba OMWAMI, ari Endikulushe eseere abaFilisiti? Witsa okhubahaana mumukhono kwanje nohomba? OMWAMI namusunjila Daudi ari Tikulukha, okhuba shindalachweya okhuhaana abaFilisiti mumukhonokwo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi niyeetsa eBaaliperazimu, Daudi nabarootselayo; nasunga mbu OMWAMI yarabuliile ' abasuku banje imbeli wanje, shinga okhurabukha khwamatsi. Khulwako yakulikha habundu yaho eliira mbu Baaliperazimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaFilisiti nibalekhaho ebifwanani ebia beenamilanga, nabo Daudi nende abandube nibabiyila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaFilisiti nibatikulukha nibeetsa khandi olundi, nibasalaana mwibanda liaRefaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolwa Daudi yareeba OMWAMI, yakalusia mbu Oratikulukha tawe; botokhana emukongo wabwe, nobeetsela khulubeka Iwemiforisati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa olahulila obuyoka bwemiyindili mubutenje bwemiforisati, habwenaho wanguyilisie; okhuba habwenaho OMWAMI wakharula imbeliwo okhurootsa lihe liabaFilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi yakhola ario, shinga olwa OMWAMI yamulaka; ne yarootsa abaFilisiti okhurula eGeba okhuula eGezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
